{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方大面积、高亮的白色正文首先吸引视线，右上角绿色目录标题是次级入口。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"想起过去自然亲近的日子，希望以后还能有类似的相处。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"心里发热、怀念、期待。\",\n  \"missed\": \"后来担心再次遇到亲近的人需要等待很久，以及逐渐接受即使没有这样的人也要好好生活、不再委屈自己的转变；右侧目录强调的是先把眼下日子过好。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"单块太长，一块里有好几层意思，既有对过去关系的回忆，也有对未来的期待、担忧和自我调整。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0181893b-e5e9-4f48-b817-8180a5f7ebbc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T020143810831Z", "elapsed_seconds": 35.766, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:02:19.583043+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2fa606af9c4008a0b2497cf22ec8fbeae62221d5e7c53a1c533d7b2e7f68c764", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"